EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Do you visit this town a lot?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}This is the sort of place{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} you want
to keep coming back to,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu kasabaya sık gelir misin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burası insanın{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
tekrar tekrar gelmek isteyeceği türden,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quando si visita una nuova città{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
si mangiano tante cose buone!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Chissà quali sono{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} le specialità
che si mangiano qui, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Garip.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Burası benim kasabam değil ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}sanki
tam buraya aitmişim gibi hissediyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}You're from this town, aren't you?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I'm having a great time camping
here!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Tu sei di qui, non è vero?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ah, mi sto divertendo un sacco
da quando sono arrivato!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Du wohnst doch hier, oder?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich campe nur hier, aber das
macht total viel Spaß!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ah, in che zona andrò a vivere?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Deciderò giocando a morra cinese
con me stesso! Sì, ecco cosa farò!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Wo ziehe ich nur hin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Hier ist es doch überall
so schön!

{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich habe spannende Neuigkeiten!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Ich ziehe hierher um!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mich eingeladen,
und da konnte ich nicht Nein sagen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wir sind also bald Nachbarn!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So right now I'm just camping here,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but pretty soon I'll be moving to
this town for good!
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} invited me, actually.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We should hang out once I'm moved
in,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ehm... Vedi, {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
mi ha invitato a trasferirmi
in questa città e ho detto di sì!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Saremo vicini di casa da ora in poi!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ci vediamo in giro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tents are a lot more comfortable
than I thought.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0019:}}They're so comfy,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm napping even more than usual.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çadırlar düşündüğümden çok daha rahatmış.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0019:}}
O kadar rahat ki{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} normalden
bile daha çok uyukluyorum.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Encender un fuego cuesta mucho,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pero merece la pena.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tengo los pies supercalentitos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Kamp yaparken her şey daha lezzetli geliyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Temiz hava sanki yemeklere megafon tutuyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lezzetin sesini sonuna kadar açıyor!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}The air in this town smells delicious!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
If only I could bottle it and bring
it back home with me!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Die Luft hier riecht echt gut!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Schade, dass ich sie nicht in eine
Flasche tun und mitnehmen kann...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've camped in a lot of places,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but I really like this town.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}It's, like,
the{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} best{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} town{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ever!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}It's weird to say,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I kind of want
to live here!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
You should move here!
Um...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono stato in un sacco di posti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma questa città mi piace molto.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Anzi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} oserei dire{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} moltissimo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}È difficile da spiegare,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma sento
che mi piacerebbe vivere qui!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Dovresti trasferirti qui!
Mmmh...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir sürü yerde kamp yaptım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama bu
kasabayı gerçekten sevdim.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Burası resmen{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} en iyi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kasaba{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Söylemesi garip ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} burada yaşayasım geldi!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
Şey...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ieri ho sognato che mi ero
trasferito definitivamente qui!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}E mi divertivo un sacco!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Aspetta, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}pensi anche tu quello
che sto pensando io?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sì! Trasferisciti qui!
Sì, era un bel sogno!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Dün gece bu kasabada yaşadığım komik bir
rüya gördüm!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hem de bayağı keyfim
yerindeydi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Söylesene, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sen de benim düşündüğümü mü düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
Güzel rüyaymış!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Well, I really love this town.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Camping here has been a lot of fun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Je me plais vraiment beaucoup ici !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu peux pas savoir combien je
me suis amusé, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ben bu kasabayı gerçekten sevdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burada kamp yapmak çok eğlenceliydi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Wer weiß?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vielleicht wird's ja
irgendwann doch noch wahr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
